  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Ministry of Development Planning in the Process of Decentralization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant objective is to support the Ministry of Development Planning for improved planning and public investment processes particularly with regards to subnational governments. The higher level objective is improved public expenditures and investments at the sub-national level. There are five components: (i) Improved public investment processes; (ii) improved planning processes; (iii) Information systems; (iv) deconcentration and support to subnational governments; (v) audit of the grant.</narrative>
  </description>
